#: data/maps/PetalburgCity/scripts.inc:700
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Text_WhereIsWally"
msgid ""
"Where has our WALLY gone?\p"
"We have to leave for VERDANTURF TOWN\n"
"very soon…$"
msgstr ""
"我们家满充跑到哪里去了呢？\p"
"我们马上就要出发去绿荫镇了……$"

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity/scripts.inc:705
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Text_AreYouRookieTrainer"
msgid ""
"Hiya! Are you maybe…\n"
"A rookie TRAINER?\p"
"Do you know what POKéMON TRAINERS\n"
"do when they reach a new town?\p"
"They first check what kind of GYM\n"
"is in the town.$"
msgstr ""
"嗨！你该不会是……\n"
"新手训练家吧？\p"
"你知道宝可梦训练家\n"
"到了新的城镇会先做什么吗？\p"
"他们会先去看看\n"
"镇上有什么样的道馆。$"

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity/scripts.inc:713
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Text_ThisIsPetalburgGym"
msgid "See? This is PETALBURG CITY's GYM.$"
msgstr "你看！这就是橙华市的道馆。$"

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity/scripts.inc:716
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Text_ThisIsGymSign"
msgid ""
"This is the GYM's sign. Look for it\n"
"whenever you're looking for a GYM.$"
msgstr ""
"这是道馆的招牌。\n"
"想找道馆的时候，就找这个吧。$"

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity/scripts.inc:720
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Text_WaterReflection"
msgid ""
"My face is reflected in the water.\p"
"It's a shining grin full of hope…\p"
"Or it could be a look of somber silence\n"
"struggling with fear…\p"
"What do you see reflected in your face?$"
msgstr ""
"水面上映出了我的脸。\p"
"那是一张充满希望、\n"
"闪闪发光的笑脸……\p"
"又或者是一张与恐惧抗争、\n"
"默默无言的阴沉面孔……\p"
"你从自己的脸上看到了什么呢？$"

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity/scripts.inc:727
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Text_FullPartyExplanation"
msgid ""
"Let's say you have six POKéMON.\n"
"If you catch another one…\p"
"It is automatically sent to a STORAGE\n"
"BOX over a PC connection.$"
msgstr ""
"假设你已经带着6只宝可梦，\n"
"如果再捉到1只的话……\p"
"它就会通过电脑\n"
"自动被送到寄放盒子里。$"

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity/scripts.inc:733
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Text_GymSign"
msgid ""
"PETALBURG CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
"LEADER: NORMAN\l"
"“A man in pursuit of power!”$"
msgstr ""
"橙华市宝可梦道馆\n"
"馆主：千里\l"
"“追求强大的男人！”$"

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity/scripts.inc:738
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Text_CitySign"
msgid ""
"PETALBURG CITY\n"
"“Where people mingle with nature.”$"
msgstr ""
"橙华市\n"
"“人与自然和谐相处的城市”$"

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity/scripts.inc:742
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Text_WallyHouseSign"
msgid "WALLY'S HOUSE$"
msgstr "满充的家$"

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity/scripts.inc:745
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Text_AreYouATrainer"
msgid ""
"Excuse me!\p"
"Let me guess, from the way you're\n"
"dressed, are you a POKéMON TRAINER?$"
msgstr ""
"打扰一下！\p"
"让我猜猜看，看你这身打扮，\n"
"你是宝可梦训练家吧？$"

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity/scripts.inc:750
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Text_WellMaybeNot"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\p"
"Well, maybe not.\n"
"Your clothes aren't all that dirty.\p"
"You're either a rookie TRAINER,\n"
"or maybe you're just an ordinary kid.$"
msgstr ""
"…… …… ……\p"
"嗯，好像不是。\n"
"你的衣服也没有那么脏。\p"
"你要么是新手训练家，\n"
"要么就只是个普通的小孩子吧。$"

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity/scripts.inc:757
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_Text_ImLookingForTalentedTrainers"
msgid ""
"I'm roaming the land in search of\n"
"talented TRAINERS.\p"
"I'm sorry to have taken your time.$"
msgstr ""
"我在各地旅行，\n"
"寻找有才华的训练家。\p"
"抱歉占用了你的时间。$"
